<title>HUNGARY: DANUBIUS GROUP H1 '97 PRE-TAX PROFIT HUF 2.524 BLN.</title>
<headline>DANUBIUS GROUP H1 '97 PRE-TAX PROFIT HUF 2.524 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six-month period ended June 30.</p>
<p>	 (Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Jan-June 1997     Jan-June 1996</p>
<p>    Operating profit	  1,104.6    vs     1,663.3</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    2,524.2    vs     1,813.8</p>
<p>    Net sales		   8,960.8    vs     8,314.7</p>
<p>    Other revenue		  49.5    vs	 390.2</p>
<p>    Material expenditures   2,739.7    vs     2,543.8</p>
<p>    Personnel expenditures  3,099.6    vs     2,658.3</p>
<p>    Depreciation		  580.7    vs	 683.3</p>
<p>    Other costs		 1,035.6    vs	 806.6</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	  451.3    vs	 353.4</p>
<p>    Net financial income    1,429.0 profit vs    67.2 profit</p>
<p>	Financial revenue     1,893.7    vs	 216.3</p>
<p>	Financial expend.	 464.7    vs	 149.1</p>
<p>    Net extraord. income	  9.5 loss vs	83.4 profit</p>
<p>	Extraord. revenue	   5.8    vs	 139.5</p>
<p>	Extraord. expend.	  15.3    vs	  56.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Danubius Hotels Rt is a hotel chain. The figures are consolidated and were calculated in accordance with Hungarian Accounting Standards. They are unaudited.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
